{"id":"hintertu_r","lemma":"Hintertür","pos":"noun","rank":3925,"glosses":["back door"],"ipa":"/ˈhɪn.tɐˌtyːɐ̯/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/06/De-Hintert%C3%BCr.ogg/De-Hintert%C3%BCr.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Hintertür","plural":"Hintertüren"},"examples":[{"text":"Die Hintertür stand offen.","en":"The back door was open.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759253","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to stand","l":"stehen"},{"g":"open"}]},{"text":"Jemand ist an der Hintertür.","en":"Someone's at the back door.","words":[{"g":"someone, somebody"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Die Hintertür war weit geöffnet.","en":"The back door was wide open.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"wide"},{"g":"open"}]},{"text":"Ich ging zur Hintertür hinaus.","en":"I went out the back door.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"out"}]},{"text":"Hast du die Hintertür abgeschlossen?","en":"Did you lock the back door?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"separate, enclosed"}]}]}